            <ArticleTitle>First steps in mindfulness skills.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>22-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the past 20 years, mindfulness has been incorporated into a number of psychological treatments for mental and physical health conditions. Nurses are now teaching mindfulness to patients in a variety of settings. This article describes the concept of mindfulness, some of the clinical populations that have been treated with this technique, a script for a simple introductory mindfulness exercise and a case study to illustrate its use.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
